      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그걸 알려 주기 위해\n난 계속해서 싸우고 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC780020C54CB8240020C8FCAE300020C704D574000AB09C0020ACC4C18DD574C11C0020C2F8C6B0ACE00020C788C5B4002E001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너, 강해지고 싶다면\n받는 데미지를 줄여 주는 기술...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이른바, 벽의 중요성을 알려 주지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002C0020AC15D574C9C0ACE00020C2F6B2E4BA74000ABC1BB2940020B370BBF8C9C0B97C0020C904C5EC0020C8FCB2940020AE30C220002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC774B978BC14002C0020BCBDC7580020C911C694C131C7440020C54CB8240020C8FCC9C0002E001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부할 거라면\n내게 말을 걸도록 해.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D5600020AC70B77CBA74000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78B3C4B85D0020D574002E001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "벽의 위대함을 알려 주지.\n준비는 됐어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCBDC7580020C704B300D568C7440020C54CB8240020C8FCC9C0002E000AC900BE44B2940020B410C5B4003F001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비됐어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44B410C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아직이야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C9C1C774C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비하고 싶지 않은 마음은 알아.\n패배하고 싶지 않겠지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44D558ACE00020C2F6C9C00020C54AC7400020B9C8C74CC7400020C54CC544002E000AD328BC30D558ACE00020C2F6C9C00020C54AACA0C9C0002E001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 포켓몬이 사용하는 기술은\n상대의 공격 데미지를 줄여 주지!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n사람에 따라서는 벽이라고 부르는 기술이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C0ACC6A9D558B2940020AE30C220C740000AC0C1B300C7580020ACF5ACA90020B370BBF8C9C0B97C0020C904C5EC0020C8FCC9C0002100100001BE00000AC0ACB78CC5D00020B530B77CC11CB2940020BCBDC774B77CACE00020BD80B974B2940020AE30C220C774C57C0021001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
